  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given reaction</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/53d8f725-3bbe-41fd-a644-f9aef03a9773-37c3a294-df6b-4681-9187-bab4b136d574-image.png\" style=\"width: 332px; height: 147px;\" /></p><p>(Where Et is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>)</p><p>The number of chiral carbon/s in product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is</p>",
    "image": null
