  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>This reaction is an example of intra molecular Claisen condensation reaction.&nbsp;The mechanism of the Claisen condensation reaction proceeds with the removal of an alpha proton through the action of a strong base to result in the formation of an enolate ion.&nbsp;</p><p>This results the formation products as follows,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/03e6b3b6-d2c4-4655-8970-9e3e71778acb-image.png\" style=\"width: 324px; height: 150px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
